This enum represents the different types of DNS records that can be created and managed through the Cloudflare API. The `id` field represents the ID used by the Cloudflare API to identify the record type. The `RecordType` enum is used in various parts of the API to specify the type of record being operated on, such as when creating, updating, or deleting records.

